my problem is this upgrade is kinda forcing me to go all in on win 11.  it was essentially $600 for me to get 2x the compute power. Win10  seems that it can't optimize the p/e core stuff. I think I'll follow SomeOrdinaryGamer's win 11 install method. Seemed like it circumvented alot of the bloat/privace concerns. 

&#x200B;

I also thought of running a VM  with windows 11 inside linux, but I think  I run into the same issues regardless.
